<title>HONG KONG: Allan Int'l interim net returns to gain.</title>
<headline>Allan Int'l interim net returns to gain.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.05 gain   vs  3.06 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    0.5	   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    6.47 profit vs  9.76 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     238.43	vs  207.95</p>
<p>    Company name		 Allan International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 23-27, 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 6, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Allan International is a plastic parts and injection moulds maker.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
